        <detaileddescription>
<para>The hazard <ref refid="structecss_1_1Memory_1_1detail_1_1DenseArrays_3_01true_01_4_1a65caeb0563609bf1ba8f1b8ea7e2bf6f" kindref="member">reserve()</ref> documents, in the other direction: shrink_to_fit reallocates, the old buffers go to the retire bin, and a view still naming them reads memory that is correct only until the next write and freed once the grace period ends. </para>
